{"id": "control-03", "category": "control", "src": "\\{大きな声で\\}叫んでも無駄だ！", "speaker": null}
{"id": "control-04", "category": "control", "src": "\\C[6]\\N[2]\\C[0]「待って、まだ話は終わってない」", "speaker": null}
{"id": "control-05", "category": "control", "src": "ここから先は\\C[2]危険地帯\\C[0]です。", "speaker": null}
{"id": "control-06", "category": "control", "src": "\\.\\.\\.ええと、何の話だっけ？", "speaker": null}
{"id": "control-07", "category": "control", "src": "\\I[87]鍵を\\V[12]個持っている。", "speaker": null}
